@host = http://localhost:5000

GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness (data present and recently checked)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Search: name or address, worst rated first, only places with reports
GET {{host}}/api/v1/places/search?q=jozefa&sort=worst&withReports=true&limit=10

### Whole dataset from memory cache
GET {{host}}/api/v1/places

### Conditionally revalidate the source (globally cooldown-limited)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/places?forceRefresh=true

### Viewport / bbox
GET {{host}}/api/v1/places?minLat=49.8&maxLat=50.2&minLon=21.8&maxLon=22.2

### Dataset metadata
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dataset

### Reports and website of one place
GET {{host}}/api/v1/places/nawiedzenia-najswietszej-maryi-panny_sucha-beskidzka/reports
